<title>NEW ZEALAND: Official segment indicators from NZ wool sales.</title>
<headline>Official segment indicators from NZ wool sales.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-05-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The official market indicator from Thursday's wool sales at Napier and Christchurch was 456 NZ cents per kg clean versus 448 at the previous sale on May 9, Wools of New Zealand said on Friday.</p>
<p>Official segment indicators, as published by Wools of New Zealand (in cents per kg clean), were:</p>
<p>    Fine     18/24 micron - 939 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Medium   25/31 micron - 567 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Strong   32/41 micron - 390 vs 381</p>
<p>    Lambs		     - 414 vs 404</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom +64 4 473 4746</p>
